            "correct_answer": "The $5T$ spectrum is denser because its spacing is $\\omega_0/5$.",
            "answer_explanation_blocks": [
              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The spacing rule is inverse in the period: $\\omega_0 = 2\\pi/T$. If the period grows to $5T$, the spacing shrinks to one-fifth of the original.",
